    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/6f6c3afbe10c726014cbca82a1c325c6.poster.avif?t=1746077193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/6f6c3afbe10c726014cbca82a1c325c6.webm?t=1746077193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/6f6c3afbe10c726014cbca82a1c325c6.mp4?t=1746077193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Pulling No Punches is a satirical game in the 2D beat'em up style with classic arcade influences and modern visuals.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/f79fe232af72582d0a52b0b31991bc38.webp?t=1746077193\" /></div><br><br>The game follows the fictional story of a global pandemic that engulfed the world and is being ignored by fanatics who do not believe that the disease is real. It is up to the main characters, 4 common citizens adequately protected with gloves and masks, to deal with these fanatics and solve the situation with the force of their own fists.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/e9b1f5585889d3ce395ebdf7ce87dd5e.poster.avif?t=1746077193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/e9b1f5585889d3ce395ebdf7ce87dd5e.webm?t=1746077193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/e9b1f5585889d3ce395ebdf7ce87dd5e.mp4?t=1746077193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/4b4bf2f259e4fc7ad132fdb0b9522be6.webp?t=1746077193\" /></div><br><br>\u25cf 4 Co-op Local Multiplayer!<br>\u25cf 4 Characters with unique Unlockables and Moves!<br>\u25cf Use everything at your disposal to destroy your enemies: a wide variety of punches, kicks, grabs and headbutts!<br>\u25cf Handmade art painfully animated frame by frame!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/6f6c3afbe10c726014cbca82a1c325c6.poster.avif?t=1746077193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/6f6c3afbe10c726014cbca82a1c325c6.webm?t=1746077193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/6f6c3afbe10c726014cbca82a1c325c6.mp4?t=1746077193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Pulling No Punches is a satirical game in the 2D beat'em up style with classic arcade influences and modern visuals.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/f79fe232af72582d0a52b0b31991bc38.webp?t=1746077193\" /></div><br><br>The game follows the fictional story of a global pandemic that engulfed the world and is being ignored by fanatics who do not believe that the disease is real. It is up to the main characters, 4 common citizens adequately protected with gloves and masks, to deal with these fanatics and solve the situation with the force of their own fists.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/e9b1f5585889d3ce395ebdf7ce87dd5e.poster.avif?t=1746077193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/e9b1f5585889d3ce395ebdf7ce87dd5e.webm?t=1746077193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/e9b1f5585889d3ce395ebdf7ce87dd5e.mp4?t=1746077193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/4b4bf2f259e4fc7ad132fdb0b9522be6.webp?t=1746077193\" /></div><br><br>\u25cf 4 Co-op Local Multiplayer!<br>\u25cf 4 Characters with unique Unlockables and Moves!<br>\u25cf Use everything at your disposal to destroy your enemies: a wide variety of punches, kicks, grabs and headbutts!<br>\u25cf Handmade art painfully animated frame by frame!",
    "short_description": "A classic 2D arcade action game animated frame by frame. Survive a fictional pandemic in a city filled with madness and denial.",
    "supported_languages": "Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cPulling No Punches hits the mark in its social critique social and very unique graphics, which reminds us a lot of Brazilian zines.\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 Jogando Casualmente<br><br>\u201cBrainDead Broccoli's Brazilian game is a punch to the chin of denialists.\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 GamerView<br><br>\u201cPulling no Punches is a Brazilian game with good gameplay and focused on the political and social message that expresses a collective revolt against denialism.\u201d<br>- \u2013 Cards Realm<br>",
